      "content": "i know there are helplines and stuff but it doesnt change the fact that nothing actually gets better. it's just a cycle. i feel like i'm just stuck in this loop of hurting myself and everyone else, and honestly, i'm starting to wonder if it would be easier if i just... stopped. like, just stopped everything. if i'm not here, the weight i put on everyone just disappears. does that even sound crazy?",
